      "writtenOn": "2020-08-19T23:51:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is no need to use version suffix for types because the types are namespaced. Only new methods accepting new types need to have a suffix, and that\u0027s only because HIDL doesn\u0027t support overloads.",
